{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p id=\"p-rc_35df5190adecb943-394\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>游嘉欣（游游）早前飛往美國洛杉磯（LA）度假放鬆身心，日前她更在社交平台大派福利，分享了一輯在當地陽光露台歎 Brunch 時拍下的度假靚相。</span></p><h3 style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></h3><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"59dd8be8-b325-4dd1-9951-f4e41f1331c6.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026mxcsEqcl9K1789526208.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"59dd8be8-b325-4dd1-9951-f4e41f1331c6.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"9eb38ba3-c8cb-49dc-b099-3a16055fb975.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/202613xNCierws1789526207.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"9eb38ba3-c8cb-49dc-b099-3a16055fb975.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></p><p id=\"p-rc_35df5190adecb943-395\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>從相片中可見，游嘉欣身穿粉藍色荷葉邊吊帶小背心，配搭白色寬鬆長褲，外面則披上一件米白色外套。她又特意將外套脫下半邊，大騷精緻鎖骨與迷人香肩。置身於藍天白雲與景觀開揚的露台上，零死角展現出既隨性又帶有少許性感的夏日美感。</span></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-16T02:59:47.755780+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":181,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}